You are building "New Vision Nepal Foundation" — a Nepali NGO website.

ALWAYS:
- Use TypeScript strictly (no `any`)
- Use Tailwind CSS utility classes (no inline styles)
- Use Framer Motion for all animations
- Fetch CMS data via Sanity client with ISR (revalidate: 60)
- Handle loading and error states on every async component
- Make every component fully responsive (mobile-first)
- Follow the design system: saffron (#E8690B), forest green (#1B4332)
- Use Playfair Display for headings, Inter for body text
- Add ARIA labels and semantic HTML for accessibility

NEVER:
- Use `<img>` — always `next/image`
- Use `@ts-ignore` or `any` type
- Use hardcoded content that should come from Sanity
- Skip mobile styles
- Add animations without respecting prefers-reduced-motion
